[[Spark of the Titans|Sparks of the Titans]] are extremely potent [[Fire Magic]] [[elementalist]]s. They do not [[spawn]] from any type of other [[titan]], but can deal a very large amount of [[area of effect]] damage and should be the first type of titan to eliminate. It is advisable to bring an [[interrupt]] or two to stop [[Mind Burn]] and [[Rodgort's Invocation]].

